				2
			],
			"Message": "docs(Rest): Add branded header to Architecture.md and fix DeepDive.md intro\n\nAdd the standard GitHub-branded logo table header to Architecture.md (matching the convention recently applied to the README), restructure the main heading with proper em-quad spacing, and reflow the introductory paragraph.\n\nFix a broken sentence in DeepDive.md where the subject was lost during a prior edit — restore the full \"Rest provides the technical foundation TypeScript compiler\" to a coherent form.\n\nNo substantive content changes.",
			"SHA": "2aa459a27a11e5cb0e31f13ddb84ffa3692118f6"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
