			],
			"Message": "style(Rest): Consolidate blank lines in bin/Rest.js\n\nContinue whitespace normalization in the CLI wrapper entry point by removing redundant blank lines between consecutive import statements, variable declarations, and logical code blocks (guard clause, execution block, error handler).\n\nThis completes the formatting pass begun in 27206fd, bringing import grouping and block spacing into alignment with standard JavaScript style conventions throughout the file. No runtime behavior changes.",
